  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the Thai chilies and cook, stirring occasionally, until fragrant and slightly softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, soy sauce, and brown sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the crumbled Comte cheese and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the warm larb in bowls and garnish with chopped cilantro."
